**Voice worker (local STT, khong dung OpenAI API)**
- Voice worker KHONG dung chung venv voi `AI-server`.
- Python dung cho voice phai la `D:\cap2\.venv-whisper\Scripts\python.exe`.
- Cai dependency rieng bang `D:\cap2\.venv-whisper\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -r D:\cap2\voice\requirements.txt`.
- Cai `ffmpeg` va dam bao `ffmpeg -version` chay duoc.
- Chay worker an toan bang `.\run_voice_worker.ps1` tu `D:\cap2`.
- Cau hinh khuyen nghi: `VOICE_WHISPER_MODEL=small`, `VOICE_WHISPER_DEVICE=cpu`, `VOICE_WHISPER_COMPUTE_TYPE=int8`, `VOICE_WHISPER_LANGUAGE=vi`.
